id: key
name: Key
kind: gear
craftDC: Qualified
# "When you create this Key, you must target a Base's Door where you are the Owner, or a Basic Item
# you created that requires it." Asked when it is given.
key: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Opens the one Base Door or Basic Item it was made for, and nothing else.
text: >
  Key: A tool to open a lock, this item is practically a necessity for any home.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Details: N/A
  –Effects: When you create this Key, you must target a Base’s Door where you are the Owner, or a
  Basic Item you created that requires it. This Key only works on that chosen target.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Given from the Gear tab: it asks which of the character's own locking Items it is for (a
# Ki-Sealing Handcuff) and opens that one and no other; or a Base's Door, which is the table's -
# there are no Bases here. A Ki-Sealing Handcuff makes its own Key with it, from this entry.
#
# --- What is not built -------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Bases and their Doors.
